Origin: DHI-internal (Directus package build harness)
Description: Keep the Directus 12.4 catalog pins while accepting the newer
 nodemailer and undici catalog versions shipped by Directus 12.5.
 The hunks apply to package/main/directus/build.sh in this repository.
Upstream catalog: https://github.com/directus/directus/blob/v12.5.0/pnpm-workspace.yaml
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/definitions c30ca203b7fd470d72a2a55ed21c467f1e7b509e path=package/main/directus
Verify: cmd `patch --dry-run -p1 --fuzz=0 --verbose -d package/main/directus -i debian-13/dhi-build-current-catalog-versions.patch` expect "Hunk #1 succeeded at 64."
Forwarded: not-needed (version-transition compatibility in the DHI build)
Drop-When: never: delete only after build.sh itself accepts nodemailer 10.0.15 and undici 7.30.0 without this debian-only delta

